*  180 - ARBNO(*P), non-recursive: *P defers to a zstatic blob (LEN(2)) — the PS-3
*        FAST-ARM target (uniform per-iteration stride, self-contained, currently on
*        the chain arm). Contrast 179 (recursive *LIST, zstatic==0 -> stays chain).
        P = LEN(2)
        S = 'aabbccddee'
        S POS(0) ARBNO(*P) RPOS(0)                            :S(OK1)F(BAD1)
OK1     OUTPUT = 'even ok'                                     :(T2)
BAD1    OUTPUT = 'even FAIL'
T2      'abcde' POS(0) ARBNO(*P) RPOS(0)                      :S(BAD2)F(OK2)
OK2     OUTPUT = 'odd rejected ok'                             :(END)
BAD2    OUTPUT = 'odd FAIL'
END
